JEMLATdGth9DAZ935C2ayI48vNxxWxVnQvjCgIDw5oU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6lEEy2Rs0QY5d_bnpmJC_SkNSUpZSiCVtr_fjUcoKuaQ&oe=6A0F22B9"}, {"file_name": "resized-Media (2).png", "id": "1137390485230685", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314623_1137390488564018_6456471858667287533_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZTxmjJiZaxYQ7kNvwH3boON&_nc_oc=Adr3tST-kY_pUSN9UC5p7uvr43V1_kRI6K0MDHCGz6EKHHMbAmRyMOnKbPE7cXiUK_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7L80srxar8qWn5K9jUC_8Ws74LDiqwaTy66Dnh7EiASQ&oe=6A0F2987"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GRO", "keywords": ["Farming", "VR", "GAG", "Garden"], "long_description": "Grow crazy plants by day. Things get wild at night! \n\nBecome a GRO BRO: https://discord.gg/gro\n\n# Magical Seeds\nPlant. Grow. Harvest. Turn tiny seeds into wild, oversized, mutated fruits.\n\n# Mutations\nRainbow. Sun-kissed. Tornado, Acid rain. Weather mutates your plants into rare, powerful versions. Stack those mutations!\n{1961694904718240}\n\n# Plants vs Jeremys\nAt night, defensive plants protect your garden. Whack wild jeremys with your friends. Beware of BLOOD MOON.\n{1471323561438861}\n\n# Garden Gear\nWatering can, sprinklers, fruit basket, OG costumes, gloves, hats, shovel. Everything you need to build your dream garden.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Plant, Harvest, GRO-w!\n\nA fantasy farming sandbox, where cozy farming meets multiplayer chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://grogame.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AutoVrse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://grogame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "19901040514470